{"4630300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CHROMATIDE", "steam_appid": 4630300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/4c53a8374431ade6a9fd2e6fd6df86fc.poster.avif?t=1780864272\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/4c53a8374431ade6a9fd2e6fd6df86fc.webm?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/4c53a8374431ade6a9fd2e6fd6df86fc.mp4?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend. Discover. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHROMATIDE is a first-person paranormal adventure set inside CHARYBDIS, a brutalist underwater station operated by the secretive OCCTech corporation. As an <strong>Emotionmateria Technician</strong>, you maintain impossible machines, follow cryptic procedures, and uncover the truth behind an experiment that should never have happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/82dbc9c38becc75960b64ce3743f1f03.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an OCCTech experiment triggers a full emergency lockdown, something is released into CHARYBDIS: Paranormal entities now roam the station. You will need to adapt to them, find alternative routes or... <strong>face the entities head on.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/b0bdc92fab309b0a92198b479415f9b9.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=14 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/85eb8f106d4662181efeddba46e312b7.poster.avif?t=1780864272\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/85eb8f106d4662181efeddba46e312b7.webm?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/85eb8f106d4662181efeddba46e312b7.mp4?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/9dc01c6b69aa17540711fa0f41781bbf.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the world through physical gestures instead of simple button presses. Turn valves, operate machinery, move objects, and manipulate the station by recreating the motions <strong>yourself with your mouse or controller stick.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHARYBDIS is dangerous, but not every threat must be fought. Search for alternate routes, use the environment, and decide when to avoid, confront, or use <strong>your surreal powers in combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/e90ca1a1d5f8c4383252ceda8ea75823.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=14 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/3ec38bb5dc2e1e4d44b566485f9e283f.poster.avif?t=1780864272\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/3ec38bb5dc2e1e4d44b566485f9e283f.webm?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/3ec38bb5dc2e1e4d44b566485f9e283f.mp4?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/89eebda8c3606724d53de2401186e13e.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a world of forbidden experiments and surreal architecture:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect secrets, recover strange artifacts, and bring them back to <strong>ROOM 15</strong> - an extradimensional safe space that shifts between realities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/b0bdc92fab309b0a92198b479415f9b9.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=14 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/68d17607bd6a77f1c529dce67b36c9fe.poster.avif?t=1780864272\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/68d17607bd6a77f1c529dce67b36c9fe.webm?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/68d17607bd6a77f1c529dce67b36c9fe.mp4?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/7a68ba028b3cd11c6dc28b05e0cb2ec9.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing in CHARYBDIS is what it seems: not your profession, not OCCTech’s mission, and not the powers granted by the <strong>mysterious Ammonite</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities like Force Push to fight, solve puzzles, and break parts of the environment as you descend deeper into the station’s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/e90ca1a1d5f8c4383252ceda8ea75823.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=14 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cinematic first-person adventure set inside a brutalist underwater station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted environments rich with detail and many mysteries to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours: use stealth, alternative routes or engage in supernatural combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metroidvania-inspired progression: revisit areas with new tools and powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack composed for CHROMATIDE.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an oppressive atmosphere of deep-sea isolation, surreal horror and reality coming apart.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/8823911b2ca06448b133c7a752570fa7.poster.avif?t=1780864272\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/8823911b2ca06448b133c7a752570fa7.webm?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/8823911b2ca06448b133c7a752570fa7.mp4?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/b0bdc92fab309b0a92198b479415f9b9.webp?t=1780864272\" width=642 height=14 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>CHROMATIDE. The debut title from LEVEL BLUE, a solo developer studio based in Berlin. Coming in 2027.</i>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/4c53a8374431ade6a9fd2e6fd6df86fc.poster.avif?t=1780864272\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/4c53a8374431ade6a9fd2e6fd6df86fc.webm?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4630300/extras/4c53a8374431ade6a9fd2e6fd6df86fc.mp4?t=1780864272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend. Discover. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHROMATIDE is a first-person paranormal adventure set inside CHARYBDIS, a brutalist underwater station operated by the secretive OCCTech corporation. As an <strong>Emotionmateria Technician</strong>, you maintain impossible machines, follow cryptic procedures, and uncover the truth behind an experiment that should never have happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 